---
---

<div class="bg-white">
  <header class="pt-10 px-10 w-full">
    <div class="flex gap-5 pb-5 border-b font-sans font-bold text-black">
      <p>[ 01 ]</p>
      <p>/about</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center lg:flex-row lg:px-20 py-5 lg:gap-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-5">
      <picture>
        <!-- Desktop view (screens 1024px and up) -->
        <source
          media="(min-width: 1024px)"
          srcset="src/assets/about_desktop_img.png"
        />

        <!-- Tablet view (screens 768px and up) -->
        <source
          media="(min-width: 768px)"
          srcset="src/assets/about_tablet_img.png"
        />

        <!-- Mobile view / Default fallback -->
        <img
          src="src/assets/about_mobile_img.png"
          alt="Responsive Hero Banner"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-xl"
        />
      </picture>

      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center opacity-60 font-mono gap-2 md:flex-row md:gap-5">
        <p class="lg:whitespace-nowrap">FULL-STACK DEVELOPER</p>
        <p class="lg:whitespace-nowrap">UI/UX DESIGNER</p>
        <p class="lg:whitespace-nowrap">SECURITY RESEARCHER</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center p-10 gap-10 md:w-[90%] lg:w-1/2 lg:gap-24 lg:items-start">
      <h1 class="text-span font-black text-3xl lg:w-4/5">
        Built like an engineer, designed like an artist, stress-tested like an
        attacker.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-lg lg:w-4/5">
        It may not be obvious, but Jerry's journey started with Full-Stack
        development. Interested in the design side of a website, he quickly
        branched out into Graphic and UI/UX design, eventually integrating a
        crucial layer of security research. This unique intersection allows him
        to manage the full project lifecycle, from visual concept to secure
        deployment, eliminating technical gaps and ensuring data safety.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:flex lg:justify-between lg:w-full">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-black text-2xl lg:text-4xl w-35">04+</h2>
          <p class="text-sm font-mono lg:text-base">YEARS EXPERIENCE</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-black text-2xl lg:text-4xl w-35">04+</h2>
          <p class="text-sm lg:text-base font-mono">YEARS EXPERIENCE</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-black text-2xl lg:text-4xl w-35">04+</h2>
          <p class="text-sm lg:text-base font-mono">YEARS EXPERIENCE</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-black text-2xl lg:text-4xl w-35">04+</h2>
          <p class="text-sm lg:text-base font-mono">YEARS EXPERIENCE</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="font-black cursor-pointer hover:opacity-50 transition-all duration-500">[ RESUME ]</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
